<title>GERMANY: Buderus posts record 220 mln 95/96 profit.</title>
<headline>Buderus posts record 220 mln 95/96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     220     vs 210</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,286   vs 3,112</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Buderus AG, the German heating appliances group. The group also said that it would likely pay a higher dividend for the 1995/1996 business year after paying a 15 mark dividend the previous year.  </p>
<p>     Group sales			    3,286   vs 3,112</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>	Heating products		     2,023   vs 1,936</p>
<p>	Iron castings			     642     vs 572</p>
<p>	Stainless steel castings		515     vs 514</p>
<p>	Aircraft components		     106     vs 90</p>
<p>    Group workforce (at Sept 30)	 10,076  vs 10,442</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Buderus AG, the German heating appliances group.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
